ory\">As of Oct 12, October to November is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, and it came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that pair ran 45% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December ran 41%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 40% of normal. On grid 19399 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 72.7, an estimate from NOAA rain that can differ from RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
